@startuml
title Appointment Tracking System - Use-Case Diagram

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam linetype ortho

actor Patient as Patient
actor "Authorized Clinic Staff" as Staff
actor "Administrative Staff" as Admin
actor "Healthcare Professional" as HCP
actor "Family Physician" as Family
actor "Specialist Physician" as Specialist
actor Nurse as Nurse
actor "Other Healthcare Professional" as Other

Staff <|-- Admin
Staff <|-- HCP
HCP <|-- Family
HCP <|-- Specialist
HCP <|-- Nurse
HCP <|-- Other

rectangle "Appointment Tracking System" {

  usecase "Request Appointment" as Request
  usecase "Book Appointment" as Book
  usecase "Confirm Appointment" as Confirm
  usecase "Reschedule Appointment" as Reschedule
  usecase "Cancel Appointment" as Cancel
  usecase "Register Patient Arrival" as Arrival

  usecase "Maintain Patient Information" as PatientInfo
  usecase "Search for Patient" as SearchPatient
  usecase "Maintain Professional and\nClinic Information" as MaintainInfo
  usecase "Manage Professional Schedule" as Schedule

  usecase "Conduct Consultation" as Consult
  usecase "Record Clinical Information" as Clinical
  usecase "Review Clinical Records" as Review
  usecase "Issue Prescription" as Prescription
  usecase "Issue Referral" as Referral
  usecase "Request Follow-up Appointment" as FollowUp

  usecase "Record Service Fees" as Fees
  usecase "Generate Invoice" as Invoice
  usecase "Register Payment" as Payment
}

Patient -- Request
Staff -- Request
Staff -- Book

Admin -- Confirm
Admin -- Reschedule
Admin -- Cancel
Admin -- Arrival
Admin -- PatientInfo
Admin -- SearchPatient
Admin -- Invoice
Admin -- Payment

HCP -- Schedule
HCP -- Consult
HCP -- Review
HCP -- Prescription
HCP -- Referral
HCP -- FollowUp

Consult ..> Clinical : <<include>>
Prescription ..> Consult : <<extend>>
FollowUp ..> Consult : <<extend>>

note right of Book
  CRITICAL UC1
  Availability and scheduling
  constraints must be checked.
  Referral rules apply when required.
end note

note right of Consult
  CRITICAL UC2
end note

note right of Referral
  CRITICAL UC3
end note

legend bottom
  CRITICAL USE CASES
  UC1: Book Appointment
  UC2: Conduct Consultation
  UC3: Issue Referral

  Other use cases are non-critical
  for detailed Iteration 1 analysis.

  Patient direct CLI access and
  maintenance permissions are unspecified.
endlegend

@enduml


